    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d268">

                <pb facs="0381" n="261" xml:id="pg261"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    Barrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-15"><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of Mr.
                    Snyder’s No. 93, of the 7th ultimo, reporting the settlement of the claim of
                    Raymond and Sophie Smith by the payment of the amount claimed, $1,500, in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">vales de extranjeros.</hi></p>
                <p>The Department approves Mr. Snyder’s action.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
